title: nanokmc-benchmarks
message: >-
  Cite this benchmark repository with the exact Git revision used, and cite the
  NanoKMC software release below. Cite the accompanying manuscript using its
  eventual published record when available. No benchmark release DOI or journal
  DOI has been assigned in the supplied citation record.
authors:
